# Code ↔ docs coupling

After meaningful edits under `apps/backend` or `apps/frontend/src`:

1. Check whether `docs/04-Workflow.md`, `docs/07-API.md`, `docs/08-Database.md`, or `docs/09-Security.md` need a prose update.
2. Run `python scripts/sync_docs_from_code.py` if routes or `schema_pg` files changed.
3. Do not invent endpoints — only document what exists in `create_app.py` and domain route modules.
